          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "News Channels"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Arcadian Morning Report"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": ": All the latest news and happenings in arcadia! Get the scoop before anyone else!"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Happiness on the Street"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": ": Happiness is everywhere! Our reporters roam the streets of arcadia to capture the most genuine smiles for you!"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "(...)"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Entertainment Channels"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Please Be Happy"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": ": The most popular elation show in arcadia, now in its sensational seventh season!"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Historical Supplicant Mask Showcase"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": ": Through the bizarre and peculiar masks of the Supplicants, popular comedy star Dovebrook Kid will regale you with fascinating tales and anecdotes from past Phantasmoon Games."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Don't Look at the Moon!"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": ": Do those of us born in arcadia truly understand the Phantasmoon? Popular tragedy star Seafeld Kid brings you a series of sorrowful, eerie, yet heartwarming tales."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Cosmic Showdown Spectacular"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": ": The masters are among the common folk, so let's uncover the daily lives of these low-key card sharks!"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "(...)"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Animation Channels"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Daybreak Squadron"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": ": Planarcadia's hottest special effect, airing every Sunday at 8 PM!"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Magical Girls of Many Faces"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": ": Save the world? Nah, our goal is to purify everyone's souls! The year's best feel-good animation, don't miss it every Friday at 9 PM!"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "(...)"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Science Channels"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "How to Safely Place a Cucumber Behind a Lightpaw"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": ": The longest and most entertaining safety education documentary in history. Season 43 is now streaming!"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Pixel Gourmet"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": ": A show tailor-made for the imagenae, bringing you the culinary habits and signature dishes of different species across the cosmos."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
